{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":1169,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}]},{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Narrator)","title":"Nerd Duck (Narrator)"},"children":["Narrator"]}," • ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Story"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":["\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["It has been too long that we've been left here starving.",{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"We must work together to take our revenge on those who wronged us.",{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"We must waddle forward. We must fight!",{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"We must take a stand and take the bread that we-"]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[]}]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["―"]},{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," in the opening cutscene for ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bathroom_Approach","title":"Bathroom Approach"},"children":["Bathroom Approach"]}]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," is the main antagonist of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Duck_Hunt_Event","title":"Duck Hunt Event"},"children":["Duck Hunt Event"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_Revenge_Event","title":"Ducky Revenge Event"},"children":["Ducky Revenge Event"]},", later turning into an ally to the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]},". With him leading the ducks in both of his main events, he can be considered the de facto leader of the ducks and potentially the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Duck_Realm","title":"Duck Realm"},"children":["Duck Realm"]}," as a whole."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," is a smart character which has invented many things. Most notable of his inventions are his mechs, which are the two Ducky D00M mechs, ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_D00M_(D00M's_Revenge)","title":"Ducky D00M (D00M's Revenge)"},"children":["II"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_D00M_III","title":"Ducky D00M III"},"children":["III"]},", and also a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Ducky","title":"Nerd Ducky"},"children":["Mecha Bunny"]},". These mechs are used by him to fight others, as he is not a particularly effective fighter without them. His other inventions include the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/P3NGU_(Ducky_Revenge)","title":"P3NGU (Ducky Revenge)"},"children":["P3NGU"]}," and a ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Bunny_Sentry","title":"Bunny Sentry"},"children":["Bunny Sentry"]},{"type":"sup","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)#cite_note-bunnysentry-1"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwFg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwFw"},"children":["["]},"1",{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwGA"},"children":["]"]}]}]}]},", which ends up being stolen by the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]},". He also shows his intellect through other means, like his work on merging the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/God_Cube","title":"God Cube"},"children":["God Cube"]}," during ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Null_&_Void_Event","title":"Null & Void Event"},"children":["Null & Void Event"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwHA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Personality"},"children":["Personality"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Nerd Duck's"]}," defining trait is his intelligence. This leads to his dialogue often being used to explain complex things to other characters. During the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_Revenge_Event","title":"Ducky Revenge Event"},"children":["Ducky Revenge Event"]},", his intelligence also impressed ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Professor_V","title":"Professor V"},"children":["Professor V"]},", causing her to ask him to work with her, something he agreed to."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["He is a good leader, as he has managed to convince ducks to help him reach his goals in both the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Duck_Hunt_Event","title":"Duck Hunt Event"},"children":["Duck Hunt Event"]}," and the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_Revenge_Event","title":"Ducky Revenge Event"},"children":["Ducky Revenge Event"]},". He also managed to get these ducks to build his inventions for him."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Nerd Duck"]}," has been shown to use any means necessary to achieve his goals. This is best seen in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_Revenge_Event","title":"Ducky Revenge Event"},"children":["Ducky Revenge Event"]},", where he sends out ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Ducky_(Ducky_Revenge)","title":"Ducky (Ducky Revenge)"},"children":["ducklings"]},{"type":"sup","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Nerd_Duck_(Story)#c